  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "A higher car insurance deductible can lower your bill. But first, do this quick break-even math that takes ten seconds.",
      "image_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261018_123847_0cfcc839-3d78-402f-9420-f320ed32e78d.png",
      "motion_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261018_123958_6419dec2-2719-4125-a152-be94dac25cf5.mp4"
    },
    {
      "text": "Your deductible is what you pay out of pocket on a claim before insurance pays the rest of the repair.",
      "image_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261018_123744_564dc13c-6524-4e2a-86f2-5ae2b6c92cee.png",
      "motion_url": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Choosing a higher deductible, like one thousand dollars instead of five hundred, usually lowers your premium for collision and comprehensive.",
      "image_url": null,
      "motion_url": null,
      "shots": [
        {
          "words": 10,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chinagudi-rohit/Social-media-workflow/ac4c29acf9283c0b39530bc92e437d474a21754e/library/motion3d/deductible/gauges.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "clip_start": 0,
          "clip_len": 5.1
        },
        {
          "words": 9,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chinagudi-rohit/Social-media-workflow/ac4c29acf9283c0b39530bc92e437d474a21754e/library/motion3d/deductible/gauges.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "clip_start": 5.1,
          "clip_len": 5.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Here is the break-even test. Divide the extra risk you take on by how much you save each year.",
      "image_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261018_123743_639566b5-a28a-4e42-999f-17301d4404a3.png",
      "motion_url": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Say one thousand saves you two hundred a year. The extra five hundred of risk pays off after two and a half claim-free years.",
      "image_url": null,
      "motion_url": null,
      "shots": [
        {
          "words": 9,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chinagudi-rohit/Social-media-workflow/ac4c29acf9283c0b39530bc92e437d474a21754e/library/motion3d/deductible/calendar.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "clip_start": 0,
          "clip_len": 3.1
        },
        {
          "words": 8,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chinagudi-rohit/Social-media-workflow/ac4c29acf9283c0b39530bc92e437d474a21754e/library/motion3d/deductible/calendar.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "clip_start": 3.1,
          "clip_len": 4.1
        },
        {
          "words": 7,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chinagudi-rohit/Social-media-workflow/ac4c29acf9283c0b39530bc92e437d474a21754e/library/motion3d/deductible/calendar.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "clip_start": 7.2,
          "clip_len": 3.6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If you rarely file claims, a higher deductible often wins over time. And the savings repeat every single year.",
      "image_url": null,
      "motion_url": null,
      "shots": [
        {
          "words": 12,
          "image_url": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3KiaiPFpiBgipyl9nPlZn5fUZ7G/hf_20261018_123744_e3cde84d-8bc2-4b79-86be-d0dc1e24a3be.png",
          "motion_url": null,
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null
        },
        {
          "words": 7,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chinagudi-rohit/Social-media-workflow/ac4c29acf9283c0b39530bc92e437d474a21754e/library/motion3d/deductible/calendar.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "clip_start": 10.8,
          "clip_len": 3.7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The catch: you need that deductible amount sitting in savings. If a surprise repair would put you in debt, stay lower.",
      "image_url": null,
      "motion_url": null,
      "shots": [
        {
          "words": 10,
          "image_url": null,
          "motion_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chinagudi-rohit/Social-media-workflow/ac4c29acf9283c0b39530bc92e437d474a21754e/library/motion3d/deductible/jar.mp4",
          "overlay": null,
          "counter": null,
          "clip_start": 0,
